  "slug": "fairness",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/3222_fairness.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Two little dogs were fighting fiercely over a cookie. Just then, a big dog came over. The little dogs saw a way to settle their argument. They stopped fighting and asked the big dog to divide the cookie for them.",
    "The big dog broke the cookie in half, and each little dog got a piece. But one little dog told the big dog that its piece was smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the other dog’s piece. Then the other little dog said its piece was now smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the first dog’s piece. The little dogs kept arguing, and the big dog kept taking bites. In the end, the big dog ate the whole cookie.",
    "It turns out that fairness is just about making both sides feel things are even!"
  ],
  "english_full": "Two little dogs were fighting fiercely over a cookie. Just then, a big dog came over. The little dogs saw a way to settle their argument. They stopped fighting and asked the big dog to divide the cookie for them.\n\nThe big dog broke the cookie in half, and each little dog got a piece. But one little dog told the big dog that its piece was smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the other dog’s piece. Then the other little dog said its piece was now smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the first dog’s piece. The little dogs kept arguing, and the big dog kept taking bites. In the end, the big dog ate the whole cookie.\n\nIt turns out that fairness is just about making both sides feel things are even!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Два́ ма́леньких пса́ бью́щими́сь жесто́ко спорили́ из-за пече́нья. То́гда́ большо́й пёс пришёл. Ма́ленькие псы́ уви́дели́ спосо́б у́ладить свой спор. Они́ прекрати́ли ссо́ру и спра́шивали большо́го пса́, чтобы он раздели́л пече́нье для них.",
    "Большо́й пёс разде́лил пече́нье пополам, и ка́ждый ма́ленький пёс получи́л кусо́к. Но один ма́ленький пёс ска́зал большо́му псу́, что его́ кусо́к меньший, и большо́й пёс отку́сил у друго́го пса́ кусо́к. То́гда друго́й ма́ленький пёс ска́зал, что его́ кусо́к те́перь меньший, и большо́й пёс отку́сил у пе́рвого пса́ кусо́к. Ма́ленькие псы́ продолжа́ли спо́рить, а большо́й пёс продолжа́л отку́сывать. В конце́ концо́в большо́й пёс съел целое пече́нье.",
    "Ока́зывается, что справедли́вость — это просто о том, чтобы обе стороны́ чувствовали, что всё ро́вно!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Dvá málen'kikh psý byúshchimís' zhestoko sporíli iz-za pechénya. Tógdá bol'shóy pyós prishel. Málen'kiye psý uvidelí sposob úladit' svoy spor. Ońi prekŕatili ssorú i spráshivali bol'shógo pyá, chtoby on razdélil pechénya dlya nikh.",
    "Bol'shóy pyós razdélil pechénya popoĺam, i kázhdý málen'kiy pyós poluchil kusók. No odin málen'kiy pyós skazál bol'shómu pyá, chto egó kusók men'shiy, i bol'shóy pyós otkúsil u drugogo pyá kusók. Tógda drugoy málen'kiy pyós skazál, chto egó kusók téper' men'shiy, i bol'shóy pyós otkúsil u peŕvogo pyá kusók. Málen'kiye psý prodolzhali sporít', a bol'shóy pyós prodolzhali otkúsyvat'. V kontsé kontśov bol'shóy pyós syel tśeloe pechénya.",
    "Okázyvayetsya, chto spravedlívost' — eto prosto o tom, chtoby obe storoný chuvstvovali, chto vsyo róvno!"
  ],
